icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/128.0.6613.119/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"944462a79bccfc3ede301b3140f00801cea8fbce8009c289130b5b73ae8d32aa"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/128.0.6613.119/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"aa0eca8177c40b63f8d14598df332a83a6cb4e991496d49d16979722e238f7a8"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/128.0.6613.119/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"239ab59109a2fb3abb01b62313d7481bee8f3ca11d487e7aa25c4e1d4b13f473"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"128.0.6613.119"}